tion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-05-27T18:33:46Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T22:46:40Z","closed_at":"2025-06-02T23:59:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106880","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106880","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106880.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106880.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-02T23:59:29Z"},"body":"This PR attempts to make the smallest, non-hacky changes to Godot's rendering and XR systems to allow implementing the Meta environment depth API entirely from GDExtension.\r\n\r\nHere are the changes:\r\n\r\n1. Allow using `RenderingDevice::texture_create_from_extension()` to create textures with depth formats\r\n2. Make it so that `XRServer::pre_render()` (and hence `OpenXRExtensionWrapper::on_pre_render()`) will run before `RSG::scene->update()` so that changes to materials will take effect for the current frame (as opposed to being queued until the beginning of the next frame, at which point the environment depth information is no longer valid)\r\n\r\nI think change nr 1 is fairly minor, and hopefully uncontroversial, but I'm looking forward hearing what the rendering folks think\r\n\r\nChange nr 2 is a little deeper, and means that `XRInterface::pre_render()` and `OpenXRExtensionWrapper::on_pre_render()` will happen a little earlier than they used to, but looking at all our current uses of those virtual methods, I think this should be fine.\r\n\r\nAlso, I think it does make more sense for `RenderingServerDefault::_draw()` to call `XRServer::pre_render()` (which marks the beggining of the frame) because it's also responsible for calling `XRServer::end_frame()` (which marks the end of the frame) - this way both life cycle functions are called in the same place.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors/pull/273 for the actual Meta environment depth API implementation\r\n\r\n_(NOTE: This supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103095 which attempted to do the same thing, but was a little more hacky.)_\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106880/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106880/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}